<% const faqs = [
  ['How much does a concrete patio cost?', 'It depends on the size, how much site preparation is needed, access for equipment and the finish you choose. Photos help us give you an initial idea, and your final price is confirmed in a written proposal after we review the site.'],
  ['What preparation does the site need?', 'Every site is different. Depending on what’s there now (grass, dirt or old concrete), preparation can include removing the existing surface, grading, a compacted base and setting forms. We explain what your project needs in the proposal.'],
  ['What finishes do you offer?', 'We’ll go over the finishes we install during the visit. If you’re not sure what you want, choose “I need guidance” on the estimate form and we’ll help you decide.'],
  ['How long does a project take?', 'It depends on the size of the project, site preparation and the weather. We confirm the schedule with you before work begins.'],
  ['How do I care for new concrete?', 'Keep foot traffic and furniture off the surface until we tell you it’s ready. After that, sweep regularly, rinse off spills and avoid harsh de-icing chemicals. We’ll give you care instructions for your project when it’s finished.'],
]; %>
<div class="faq">
  <% faqs.forEach(([q, a]) => { %>
  <details class="reveal"><summary><%= q %> <%- icon('chevron') %></summary><p><%= a %></p></details>
  <% }) %>
</div>
